prompt:
Draw EXACTLY TWELVE complete whole-character Darklight Requiem game sprites, 3 rows x4 columns, TRUE TRANSPARENT background. Generous gutters, no labels/floor/cast shadow. Entire figures and attached armor/effects must stay separated and visible. Use crisp detailed pixel-style clusters, no blur.
References: 1 locks the CAMERA/DIRECTION of every pose;2 is the TARGET TRANSFORMATION and skin design authority;3 is eyes/skin reference.
SKIN: Rock wears SLEEVELESS short studded black leather VEST, skull graphic shirt, muscular BARE upper arms and black cargo trousers. Gauntlets cover only forearms. NO long coat or sleeves.
FORM: RUPTURA: individually drawn ruby RED shoulder CRYSTALS with jagged volumetric silhouettes, distinct ruby-red locks through lower brown wavy hair, red coat/vest piping. Clear bright scarlet supernatural flame seams and small red energy licks around neutral steel fists and armored feet.
CAMERA: S. SOUTH/front; face and chest toward viewer, feet forward. Keep this view through ALL12, including walking/attacks. Transfer costume from ref2 into camera1. Do not copy ref2 front facing.
CRITICAL REPAIR: These forms must have independently authored transformed hair, actual shoulder crystals and costume trim, NEVER a red/purple color filter over a normal sprite. Metal armor stays DARK NEUTRAL STEEL with SILVER/brushed bronze lit facets and neutral charcoal recesses. Clothes stay black/charcoal. Colored light only on narrow magic seams and aura OUTSIDE fists/forearms/shins/feet. No tinted skin, colored cheek/neck shadows, red blush, red face outline or crimson shadow wash. Warm peach skin base RGB246,174,130 with SOFT DESATURATED PEACH/BROWN shadows, neutral outlines. Natural clean face. Red irises #C40814, darker iris #5A0000 ONLY within tiny actual eyes; do not paint eyelids or cheek red. Keep purple form PURPLE locks/crystals, not red.
Same young compact approved large-head proportions and identical scale across all poses. Preserve anatomical asymmetry and hip chain. Paired curved fang-ridged dark steel gauntlets fist-to-forearm and greaves shin-to-foot, recognizable original weapon silhouette. No handheld weapon. Draw NEW complete figures; no anatomy collage, image mirroring, flat rotations or hue overlays. Small contained form-colored impacts, no giant flames.
POSES left-to-right each row:
READ LEFT TO RIGHT, then next row:
0 relaxed low fighting guard, both feet grounded, face/armor visible where view permits;
1 distinct soft breathing guard, subtle elbow/torso/coat motion with fixed foot contact;
2 straight-punch anticipation, right fist back, other fist guarding, weight rear;
3 explosive fully extended straight punch along requested ground-plane direction, compact energy knuckle impact;
4 recovered guard with chambered knee preparing kick;
5 powerful extended side kick along requested direction, other boot grounded, complete armor visible;
6 spinning roundhouse contact, natural torso turn, leg extended, short energy crescent;
7 crouched uppercut anticipation, fist low, boots grounded;
8 rising aerial uppercut, one knee lifted, entire body airborne, rising compact trail;
9 aerial downward axe kick, one foot high, opposite boot striking down, fists guarding;
10 wide low double-fist ground-slam contact, whole head visible, compact energy shock burst;
11 balanced recovery to requested main-direction fighting guard, settling clothes. Genuine distinct drawings.
Keep anticipation visibly withdrawn, contact extended. Direction belongs to body AND ground-plane strike. S strikes toward camera, N strikes away from camera, W left, E right; diagonal strikes follow that diagonal. Standing feet ground at a stable line per row. Airborne poses complete. Aura/impacts follow form color, avoid tinting eyes or skin.
